secondary); margin: 6px 0px;">Search is unavailable in Expert Mode. Please =
use Instant Mode.</div><div class=3D"ds-markdown ds-assistant-message-main-=
content"><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Here is a deta=
iled, reliable, real-world system architecture for behavioral packet filter=
ing using Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN), described at the software sy=
stems level (no code).</span></p><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span c=
lass=3D"">This architecture reflects how modern AI-driven Network Detection=
 and Response (NDR) and next-generation firewalls (e.g., Darktrace, Vectra =
AI, Palo Alto Cortex XDR) integrate deep learning, specifically CNNs, into =
the packet filtering pipeline without resorting to Deep Packet Inspection (=
DPI) alone.</span></p><hr><h3><span class=3D"">1. Architectural Overview: T=
he Cognitive Firewall</span></h3><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span c=
lass=3D"">The system is designed as a </span><strong><span class=3D"">hybri=
d, two-path architecture</span></strong><span class=3D"">:</span></p><ul><l=
i><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Fast Path (In=
line):</span></strong><span class=3D""> A real-time enforcement engine usin=
g traditional signature/rule-based filtering combined with a lightweight in=
ference engine for the trained CNN model.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds=
-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Deep Path (Out-of-band/Asynch=
ronous):</span></strong><span class=3D""> A high-latency, high-compute path=
 for flow aggregation, feature engineering, CNN inference, and behavioral c=
lassification. Results from this path update the Fast Path=E2=80=99s behavi=
oral profiles.</span></p></li></ul><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span=
 class=3D"">The core philosophy is that a packet alone is not filtered; the=
 </span><strong><span class=3D"">behavioral pattern of the flow/session</sp=
an></strong><span class=3D""> to which the packet belongs is classified, an=
d this verdict is cached for all subsequent packets.</span></p><hr><h3><spa=
n class=3D"">2. Layered System Architecture</span></h3><p class=3D"ds-markd=
own-paragraph"><span class=3D"">The system is divided into six distinct lay=
ers, spanning the data plane, control plane, and management plane.</span></=
p><h4><span class=3D"">Layer 1: Intelligent Packet Broker &amp; Acquisition=
</span></h4><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">This layer =
sits at the network edge (physical/virtual TAP or inline bridge).</span></p=
><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area ds-scroll-area--show-on-focus-within ds-scrol=
l-area--enabled _1210dd7 c03cafe9"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__gutters" s=
tyle=3D"--container-height: 384px; position: sticky; top: 0px; left: 0px; r=
ight: 0px; width: 100%; height: 0px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__horizon=
tal-gutter" style=3D"left: 0px; right: 0px; display: block; top: calc(var(-=
-container-height) - 14px); height: 10px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__ho=
rizontal-bar" style=3D"display: none;"></div></div><div class=3D"ds-scroll-=
area__vertical-gutter" style=3D"right: 0px; top: 8px; bottom: calc(0px - va=
r(--container-height) + 8px); width: 10px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__v=
ertical-bar" style=3D"display: none;"></div></div></div><table><thead><tr><=
th><span class=3D"">Component</span></th><th><span class=3D"">Function</spa=
n></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Zero-Copy Packe=
t Capture Engine</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">Uses kernel-bypas=
s technologies (DPDK, AF_XDP, Netmap) to grab raw packets from NICs at line=
-rate (10Gbps=E2=80=93100Gbps) with minimal CPU overhead. No filtering happ=
ens here.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Hardware RSS (Re=
ceive Side Scaling)</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">Distributes pa=
cket tuples (5-tuple hash) across multiple Rx queues, ensuring that all pac=
kets from a single flow are processed by the same CPU core. This is critica=
l for stateful flow reconstruction.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span c=
lass=3D"">Inline-Bypass Logic</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">If t=
he system fails, mechanical/optical relays ensure network continuity. This =
is a physical availability component, not software.</span></td></tr></tbody=
></table></div><h4><span class=3D"">Layer 2: Flow Assembly &amp; Stateful S=
ession Tracking</span></h4><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=
=3D"">Packets are not analyzed in isolation. This layer reconstructs bidire=
ctional communication streams.</span></p><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area ds-sc=
roll-area--show-on-focus-within ds-scroll-area--enabled _1210dd7 c03cafe9">=
<div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__gutters" style=3D"--container-height: 384px; =
position: sticky; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; width: 100%; height: 0px=
;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__horizontal-gutter" style=3D"left: 0px; rig=
ht: 0px; display: block; top: calc(var(--container-height) - 14px); height:=
 10px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__horizontal-bar" style=3D"display: non=
e;"></div></div><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__vertical-gutter" style=3D"rig=
ht: 0px; top: 8px; bottom: calc(0px - var(--container-height) + 8px); width=
: 10px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__vertical-bar" style=3D"display: none=
;"></div></div></div><table><thead><tr><th><span class=3D"">Component</span=
></th><th><span class=3D"">Function</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>=
<strong><span class=3D"">Parallel Flow Reassembly Engines</span></strong></=
td><td><span class=3D"">Each CPU core runs a dedicated engine that processe=
s its assigned Rx queue. It uses a </span><strong><span class=3D"">Flow Tab=
le</span></strong><span class=3D""> (hash-map in huge pages memory) keyed b=
y the 5-tuple + VLAN.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Prot=
ocol Metadata Extraction (Light)</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">E=
xtracts only Layer 3/4 metadata: packet timestamps (inter-arrival times), T=
CP flags (SYN, FIN, RST, PSH sequencing), segment sizes, out-of-order count=
ers, TTL values. Payload is explicitly ignored for this path.</span></td></=
tr><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Flow Timeout Manager</span></strong></t=
d><td><span class=3D"">Manages flow lifecycle. An idle flow is exported to =
the Deep Path after a configurable timeout (e.g., 15s) or upon FIN/RST. Lon=
g-lived flows (e.g., 1GB downloads) are periodically checkpointed (e.g., ev=
ery 30 seconds).</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h4><span class=3D""=
>Layer 3: Behavioral Feature Extractor (The CNN Bridge)</span></h4><p class=
=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">This is the critical transforma=
tion layer where raw network metadata becomes a CNN-compatible spatial stru=
cture. It runs in the Deep Path.</span></p><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragrap=
h"><strong><span class=3D"">The Core Concept: Conversion of Flow Metadata t=
o a Channel Map</span></strong><span class=3D""></span><br><span class=3D""=
>A single flow=E2=80=99s behavior over a time window </span><span class=3D"=
katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/M=
ath/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"appli=
cation/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-=
html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=
=3D"height:0.6833em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal" style=3D"margi=
n-right:0.13889em;">W</span></span></span></span><span class=3D""> is conve=
rted into a multi-channel 2D matrix, analogous to an image.</span></p><ul><=
li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Rows:</span>=
</strong><span class=3D""> Time bins (e.g., 100 sequential time slices).</s=
pan></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"=
">Columns:</span></strong><span class=3D""> Statistical descriptors for tha=
