ong><span class=3D"">Layer 1 =E2=80=93 The Intelligent Packet Broker &amp; =
Acquisition Layer</span></strong><span class=3D""> on a </span><strong><spa=
n class=3D"">modern Windows 10 (21H2 or later) system</span></strong><span =
class=3D"">.</span></p><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">=
The goal of this layer is singular: </span><strong><span class=3D"">capture=
 every packet from the wire with nanosecond-precision timestamps and forwar=
d them to the flow assembly engine without loss, duplication, or kernel int=
erference.</span></strong></p><hr><h2><span class=3D"">1. Environmental Pre=
requisites &amp; Tool Selection</span></h2><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragrap=
h"><span class=3D"">Windows 10 is not a real-time OS. Standard WinSock/NDIS=
 capture will drop packets under load. This implementation relies on a </sp=
an><strong><span class=3D"">kernel-bypass</span></strong><span class=3D""> =
driver and a specialized user-space library.</span></p><div class=3D"ds-scr=
oll-area ds-scroll-area--show-on-focus-within ds-scroll-area--enabled _1210=
