lass=3D"">Npcap</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">=E2=89=A5 1.70</sp=
an></td><td><span class=3D"">The NDIS 6 Lightweight Filter (LWF) driver tha=
t replaces WinPcap. Provides raw packet capture with kernel-bypass through =
its companion API. </span><strong><span class=3D"">Must be installed in "Wi=
nPcap API-compatible Mode" with "Support raw 802.11 traffic" disabled for e=
thernet.</span></strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Npcap SD=
K</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">Matching version</span></td><td>=
<span class=3D"">Provides the </span><code>npcap.h</code><span class=3D""> =
headers and </span><code>Packet.dll</code><span class=3D""> user-space libr=
ary for zero-copy, high-performance capture loops. We use it in </span><str=
ong><span class=3D"">Direct Packet Access (DMA)</span></strong><span class=
=3D""> mode where possible.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"=
">Windows Packet Filter (WinpkFilter)</span></strong></td><td><span class=
=3D"">3.0+ (Optional, Advanced)</span></td><td><span class=3D"">A dedicated=
 NDIS 5/6 intermediate driver. Offers a more deterministic filtering path p=
re-NDIS stack if Npcap overhead is too high, but Npcap's latest LWF mode is=
 preferred for maintainability.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=
=3D"">Visual Studio Build Tools</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">20=
22 (v143)</span></td><td><span class=3D"">Required to compile the custom ac=
quisition service with MSVC. The C++ compiler must support C++17 atomics fo=
r lock-free ring buffers.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">=
Windows 10 Pro for Workstations / Enterprise</span></strong></td><td><span =
class=3D"">21H2 or 22H2</span></td><td><span class=3D"">Required for RSS (R=
eceive Side Scaling) configuration on high-end NICs. Home edition lacks the=
se network QoS controls.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=3D"=
ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Critical Pre-Installation S=
tep:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span cl=
ass=3D"">Disable Windows Defender Real-time Scanning on the capture process=
=E2=80=99s working directory and the ring-buffer memory-mapped file paths. =
Anti-virus hooking into file I/O will cause non-deterministic latency spike=
s.</span></p></li></ul><hr><h2><span class=3D"">2. Network Adapter Configur=
