h2><h3><span class=3D"">Temporary Result (In-Memory, Within Layer 2)</span>=
</h3><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">The </span><strong=
><span class=3D"">Flow Table</span></strong><span class=3D""> (</span><code=
>tbb::concurrent_hash_map</code><span class=3D"">) is the living state. For=
 each active flow, it holds:</span></p><ul><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-para=
graph"><span class=3D"">A 256-element circular buffer of per-packet metadat=
a (timestamp, direction, length, flags, TTL).</span></p></li><li><p class=
=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Running counters: total bytes i=
n/out, packet count, SYN count, FIN seen flag.</span></p></li><li><p class=
=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Timestamps: first_seen, last_se=
en.</span></p></li></ul><h3><span class=3D"">Final Result (Handover Artifac=
t to Layer 3)</span></h3><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"=
">The final, consumable output is a </span><strong><span class=3D"">FlatBuf=
fer-serialized Flow Record</span></strong><span class=3D""> written into th=
e shared memory segment </span><code>Local\CognitiveFW_FlowExport</code><sp=
an class=3D"">.</span></p><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D=
"">Each exported record contains:</span></p><ul><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown=
-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Flow Identity:</span></strong><span cl=
ass=3D""> 5-tuple + VLAN ID.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-par=
agraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Flow Statistics:</span></strong><span clas=
s=3D""> Total duration, total bytes (in/out), total packets, TCP flag aggre=
gate counts.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>=
<span class=3D"">Packet Metadata Sequence:</span></strong><span class=3D"">=
 A time-ordered array of </span><code>[timestamp, direction, length, tcp_fl=
ags, ip_ttl]</code><span class=3D""> structs. For a typical flow, this is 5=
0=E2=80=93200 entries. For long flows checkpointed hourly, this is the most=
 recent 256 packets.</span></p></li></ul><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"=
><span class=3D"">The </span><code>Local\CognitiveFW_FlowReady_Sem</code><s=
pan class=3D""> semaphore signals Layer 3 =E2=80=93 Behavioral Feature Extr=
actor that a new flow record is available for immediate processing and tens=
or construction.</span></p></div></div><div class=3D"ds-flex _0a3d93b" styl=
