ass=3D"">). Signals Layer 4.</span></p></li></ul><p class=3D"ds-markdown-pa=
ragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Why no complex concurrent data structures=
 internally?</span></strong><span class=3D""></span><br><span class=3D"">Ea=
ch flow is an independent unit of work. A worker processes one flow start-t=
o-finish. No shared state between workers except the input/output queues. T=
his eliminates lock contention entirely during the compute-heavy phase.</sp=
an></p><hr><h2><span class=3D"">5. Detailed Runtime Workflow</span></h2><h3=
