/svg></div><h3><span class=3D"">Phase D: Statistical Function Details</span=
></h3><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Shannon E=
ntropy Computation (Intel MKL accelerated):</span></strong></p><ul><li><p c=
lass=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Build a histogram of unique=
 values.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=
=3D"">Normalize to probabilities.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdow=
n-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Compute </span><code>-sum(p * log2(p))</code>=
<span class=3D"">.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><s=
pan class=3D"">MKL's </span><code>vsLog2</code><span class=3D""> applies lo=
garithm to entire vector in one SIMD call.</span></p></li></ul><p class=3D"=
ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">FFT for IAT Spectrum:</span=
></strong></p><ul><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><code>vslCorrNewTa=
sk1D</code><span class=3D""> with MKL DFTI interface.</span></p></li><li><p=
 class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Input: real-valued IAT se=
quence (length =E2=89=A4 number of packets in bin).</span></p></li><li><p c=
lass=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Zero-pad to 32 points.</spa=
n></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Output: =
32 complex values. Take magnitude =3D </span><code>sqrt(real=C2=B2 + imag=
=C2=B2)</code><span class=3D"">.</span></p></li></ul><p class=3D"ds-markdow=
n-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Higher-Order Moments (Columns 3-31 of=
 Channel 3):</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph">=
<span class=3D"">Moment 3 (skewness): Asymmetry of packet size distribution=
.</span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Mo=
ment 4 (kurtosis): "Tailedness" =E2=80=94 indicates presence of outliers.</=
span></p></li><li><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">These=
 distinguish exfiltration bursts (high kurtosis) from normal web browsing.<=
/span></p></li></ul><h3><span class=3D"">Phase E: Tensor Export (Dispatcher=
 Thread)</span></h3><div class=3D"md-code-block md-code-block-dark"><div cl=
ass=3D"md-code-block-banner-wrap"><div class=3D"md-code-block-banner md-cod=
