span class=3D""> on Windows 10.</span></p><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph=
"><span class=3D"">This layer is the </span><strong><span class=3D"">decisi=
on authority</span></strong><span class=3D"">. It transforms probabilistic =
CNN verdicts into deterministic, auditable, and context-aware enforcement a=
ctions. It is the last layer before packets are actually blocked or allowed=
.</span></p><hr><h2><span class=3D"">1. Architectural Philosophy: Determini=
sm Over Probability</span></h2><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span cla=
ss=3D"">The CNN produces probabilities. A firewall must produce binary deci=
sions (ALLOW/DROP) with zero ambiguity and full auditability. Layer 5 bridg=
es this gap through:</span></p><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area ds-scroll-area-=
