<span class=3D"">A forward-chaining rules engine, not a neural network. Eve=
ry decision is traceable to a specific rule.</span></td></tr><tr><td><stron=
g><span class=3D"">Context Enrichment</span></strong></td><td><span class=
=3D"">CNN verdict alone is insufficient. Asset criticality, threat intellig=
ence, time-of-day, and user identity transform a "suspicious flow" into a "=
confirmed threat to a critical asset."</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><spa=
n class=3D"">Veridct Caching</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">Once =
a decision is made, it is pushed to the Fast Path (Layer 6) as an O(1) look=
up entry. The Policy Engine does not evaluate every packet.</span></td></tr=
><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Human-in-the-Loop Readiness</span></stron=
g></td><td><span class=3D"">For high-value assets, the engine can generate =
