nt"><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">Here is the detaile=
d implementation workflow for </span><strong><span class=3D"">Layer 6 =E2=
=80=93 The Fast Path Enforcement Engine</span></strong><span class=3D""> on=
 Windows 10.</span></p><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">=
This layer is the </span><strong><span class=3D"">physical enforcement poin=
t</span></strong><span class=3D"">. It is the only layer that operates in t=
he actual packet forwarding path, making ALLOW/DROP decisions on every pack=
et in nanoseconds to microseconds. Every other layer exists to feed this on=
e with actionable intelligence.</span></p><hr><h2><span class=3D"">1. Archi=
tectural Philosophy: The Two-Plane Separation</span></h2><p class=3D"ds-mar=
kdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">The most critical design principle of the=
 entire system is enforced here:</span></p><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area ds-=
scroll-area--show-on-focus-within ds-scroll-area--enabled _1210dd7 c03cafe9=
"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__gutters" style=3D"--container-height: 213px=
; position: sticky; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; width: 100%; height: 0=
px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__horizontal-gutter" style=3D"left: 0px; r=
ight: 0px; display: block; top: calc(var(--container-height) - 14px); heigh=
t: 10px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__horizontal-bar" style=3D"display: n=
one;"></div></div><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__vertical-gutter" style=3D"r=
ight: 0px; top: 8px; bottom: calc(0px - var(--container-height) + 8px); wid=
th: 10px;"><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area__vertical-bar" style=3D"display: no=
ne;"></div></div></div><table><thead><tr><th><span class=3D"">Plane</span><=
/th><th><span class=3D"">Location</span></th><th><span class=3D"">Latency B=
udget</span></th><th><span class=3D"">Function</span></th></tr></thead><tbo=
dy><tr><td><strong><span class=3D"">Fast Path (Data Plane)</span></strong><=
/td><td><span class=3D"">Kernel or Hypervisor</span></td><td><span class=3D=
"">&lt; 5 =C2=B5s per packet</span></td><td><span class=3D"">Stateless or m=
inimal-state packet filtering based on pre-computed verdicts. No allocation=
, no logging, no DNS lookups.</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong><span class=
=3D"">Deep Path (Control Plane)</span></strong></td><td><span class=3D"">Us=
er-space (Layers 1-5)</span></td><td><span class=3D"">100 ms =E2=80=93 30 s=
econds</span></td><td><span class=3D"">Full behavioral analysis, CNN infere=
nce, context enrichment, policy evaluation.</span></td></tr></tbody></table=
></div><p class=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Why this=
 separation is non-negotiable:</span></strong><span class=3D""></span><br><=
span class=3D"">A 10 Gbps link delivers ~14.8 million packets per second. T=
hat is 67 nanoseconds per packet. Any user-space context switch, heap alloc=
ation, or lock acquisition in the forwarding path causes catastrophic packe=
t loss. Layer 6 exists entirely to avoid this.</span></p><hr><h2><span clas=
s=3D"">2. Tools, Frameworks &amp; Dependencies</span></h2><p class=3D"ds-ma=
rkdown-paragraph"><span class=3D"">This is the most platform-specific layer=
. On Windows 10, we have three implementation tiers, escalating in performa=
nce and complexity.</span></p><div class=3D"ds-scroll-area ds-scroll-area--=
